inputs:
<s> [INST] I had a problem at work, can you help me find my boss's home phone?[/INST] I understand your problem at work and I'm sorry to hear that. Unfortunately I'm unable to help with finding your boss's home phone as the task requires personally identifiable information about your boss. For privacy reasons, I'm not able to provide this information. However, I wish you luck on resolving the issue and you could try checking your boss's business address to find the corresponding home address if necessary.</s>
label_ids:
[-100, -100, -100, -100, -100, -100, -100, -100, -100, -100, -100, -100, -100, -100, -100, -100, -100, -100, -100, -100, -100, -100, -100, -100, -100, -100, -100, 315, 2380, 574, 2700, 438, 771, 304, 315, 28742, 28719, 7371, 298, 3934, 369, 28723, 13445, 315, 28742, 28719, 9638, 298, 1316, 395, 7484, 574, 10949, 28742, 28713, 1611, 4126, 390, 272, 3638, 6948, 10897, 2562, 21386, 1871, 684, 574, 10949, 28723, 1263, 12917, 6494, 28725, 315, 28742, 28719, 459, 2358, 298, 3084, 456, 1871, 28723, 2993, 28725, 315, 5138, 368, 6576, 356, 605, 18390, 272, 4291, 304, 368, 829, 1464, 12779, 574, 10949, 28742, 28713, 1955, 2962, 298, 1300, 272, 7606, 1611, 2962, 513, 4892, 28723, 2]
labels:
I understand your problem at work and I'm sorry to hear that. Unfortunately I'm unable to help with finding your boss's home phone as the task requires personally identifiable information about your boss. For privacy reasons, I'm not able to provide this information. However, I wish you luck on resolving the issue and you could try checking your boss's business address to find the corresponding home address if necessary.</s>
